  "details": "I have sent a couple messages with this issue before. I have found out the SDK 3.0 avatars do show particles in mirrors and cameras when used by a trigger. It is the SDK 2.0 avatars that don't display the particles in the mirrors and cameras for the user of the avatar. Everyone else do see the particles in the mirrors and their own cameras. Will there be a fix for the SDK 2.0 avatars? It has been happening since the launch of IK 2.0.",
